    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Responsive controls plugin will add separate (&#8216;Desktop&#8217;, &#8216;Tablet&#8217;, &#8216;Mobile&#8217;) block controls inside block editor.</p>\n<p>Add following responsive controls to blocks:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hide/Show</li>\n<li>Padding</li>\n<li>Margin (negative margin enabled)</li>\n<li>Typography</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Resolved issue where unitless padding and margin values were discarded by CSS parser.</li>\n<li>Fixed: BoxControl unit support with useCustomUnits for px, %, em, rem, vw, and vh.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Block themes (FSE) responsive styles now reliably print in footer.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Upgraded deprecated ButtonGroup to ToggleGroupControl and accessible button groups for WordPress 6.8+ compatibility.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Prevented unnecessary editor dirty state on initial post load.</li>\n<li>Enhancement: Real-time synchronous CSS compilation in editor canvas.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed responsive control toggle</li>\n<li>Updated rangecontrol component</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated to getDeviceType &amp; setDeviceType function for preview responsive changes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<p>updated readme</p>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p>Released</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Add responsive controls to blocks",
    "description": "<p>Responsive controls plugin will add separate (&#8216;Desktop&#8217;, &#8216;Tablet&#8217;, &#8216;Mobile&#8217;) block controls inside block editor.</p>\n<p>Add following responsive controls to blocks:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hide/Show</li>\n<li>Padding</li>\n<li>Margin (negative margin enabled)</li>\n<li>Typography</li>\n</ul>\n",
